                    "id": "9aba6b63-f49d-4e0e-97ca-9e54fc60ce4a"
                }
            ],
            "desc": "<p>Open source CMS projects are competing with headless SaaS platforms, AI-generated sites, and no-code builders. In this opening keynote, Grace looks at what Drupal has going for it that those platforms don't, and where the community needs to invest next to stay relevant for the next ten years.</p>\n",
            "links": {}
